# Belt-and-suspenders alongside the root .gitignore fix (tmp/ was only
# excluded via the machine-local .git/info/exclude, which EAS's archiver
# doesn't read). .easignore patterns are gitignore-style and only reach
# within this directory, so this covers mobile/'s own tree; the actual fix
# for the outer repo's tmp/ (1.7GB Python venv) is in the root .gitignore.
node_modules
.expo
.git
*.log
